shayad un ki aabru hone lagi
subuk-sar ban ke kya puchhen ki ham se sargiran kyuun ho
hava ke saath musafir ka naqsh-e-pa bhi gaya
kabhi faraz nae mausamon men ro dena
ba-qadr-e-zarf hai saaqi khumar-e-tishna-kami bhi
uruuj teri khabar jab zaval leta hai
ek guuna be-khudi darkar hai
main sochta tha ki lautunga ajnabi ki tarah
dil gaya raunaq-e-hayat gai
jabr par sabr kiya karte hain
vo mire samne hi gaya aur main
dekh kar husn-e-behijab-e-sukhan
kis shabahat ko liye aaya hai darvaze pe chand
aaj zara fursat paai thi aaj use phir yaad kiya
khatm khush-fahmi ki manzil ka safar bhi ho gaya
